Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:24.44,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:24.49,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}手
