Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:28.77,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(833.208,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.09,0:01:28.82,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.87,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:28.92,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.97,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1086.792,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:47.27,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつもひとりで歩いてた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:54.81,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}振り返るとみんなは遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:24:02.42,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでもあたしは歩いた
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.59,0:24:08.09,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それが強さだった
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:15.92,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}もう何も恐くない
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:24.46,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そう呟いてみせる
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:35.64,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつか人は一人になって
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:43.31,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}思い出の中に生きてくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:51.11,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}孤独さえ愛し笑ってられるように
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:57.93,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}あたしは戦うんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.65,0:25:06.29,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}涙なんて見せないんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.79,0:25:13.66,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}いつもひとりで歩いてた
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:19.97,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}みんなが待っていた
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:31.64,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}いつか人は一人になって
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.64,0:25:39.32,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}思い出の中に生きてくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:46.98,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}その時はもう強くなんかないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.98,0:26:02.67,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}普通の女の子の弱さで涙を零すよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:47.27,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一路走來形單影隻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:54.81,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}轉身回望大家已經遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.42,0:24:02.42,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使如此我依然前行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.59,0:24:08.09,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這曾是我的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:15.92,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我已無所畏懼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:24.46,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}總是這樣輕聲提醒自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:35.64,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}總有一天  人將學會獨立
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.64,0:24:43.31,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在回憶中尋找自己的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:51.11,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}為了那笑容下與孤獨作伴的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.11,0:24:57.93,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}我選擇了戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.65,0:25:06.29,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}不再流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.79,0:25:13.66,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}一路走來形單影隻
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:19.97,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}原來大家早已等在前方
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:31.64,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}總有一天  人將學會獨立
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.64,0:25:39.32,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}在回憶中尋找自己的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.32,0:25:46.98,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}那個時候我已不再堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.98,0:26:02.67,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}像普通的女孩子一樣流下眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  我們也開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  給我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麼時候成為我們的同伴了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  事到如今還說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是來代替一無是處的你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘記了嗎  渣子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.19,0:02:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像廁紙一樣悲慘地消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏可是正在為我們而努力著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要趁這個機會  和戰線全體成員都見個面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼事嗎  你們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們算是準備好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽了你的話  也就信服了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是拿定主意了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣的的一夥人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實不說也早就明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且主唱也已經不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替代岩澤同學和唯的人不會再有了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.64,0:02:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那還真是讓人頭痛的主唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天都像在過文化祭  真的很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  除了我們以外的人可不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做的話就做到底吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:03:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我們好像變成被你說服而消失了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一直維持至今的這個戰線消失的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界和你也算是完成了應有的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算是個不錯的結局吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們過上了一段本不存在的青春
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這是一段快樂的時光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:27.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我覺得這也就足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢  我聽不懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:36.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  之後的事情就不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在就走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:42.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  新人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.16,0:03:46.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次還會搞樂隊的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  一定還會喜歡上的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目送庶民們的離去  辛苦您了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的性格肯定有缺陷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:03.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完美無缺  你這傢伙竟敢對神口出狂言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.25,0:04:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別犯傻了  快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然會有這麼多…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,NPC呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這附近只剩它們了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它們該不會知道我們想要幹什麼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  雜魚們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野田？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是野田
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你願意為我們而戰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.61,0:04:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說傻話了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只會在救小百合的時候出手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真是個用情專一的傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大山？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.58,0:05:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我沒什麼長處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果能在這裡一展身手的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神也會大跌眼鏡的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  讓他刮目相看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可別忘了還有我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.78,0:05:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就這樣消失掉的話  恐怕沒人會注意到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在最後…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come  on    Come  on    Come  on!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Knockin'  on  heaven's  door
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是鮑勃迪倫的歌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過卻正符合現在的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:41.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下子演員們都到齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:49.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說你才是出了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到山裡去修行了一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡沒什麼可吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是松下五段啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.89,0:06:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tasty  candy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瘦了很多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  反而更加犀利了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定現在連百人組手都能闖過去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是空手道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:19.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之  真是幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟敵人有這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平安離開這裡吧  所有人一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Goodbye  wild  heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衝過去！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:40.71,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說到Guild  雖然是個絕佳的潛伏場所沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:41.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但居然變成敵人的地盤…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.53,0:06:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可是我們的大本營啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是  肯定會出現呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成群結隊的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無大哥  請看下面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還在不斷增加著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一百個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:18.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就當是增加一百個人的戰鬥力好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:24.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來繼承你的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椎名…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  剩下的就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我來  日向
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪裡啊  音無大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:41.33,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B7
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.77,0:07:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,數量還在增加也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個方向是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快沒子彈了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種數量靠手槍可突破不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小百合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Guild的大家都已經知道情況了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經在向地面進發了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.37,0:08:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶上這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥會結束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  會結束的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們也該解散了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:28.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為有你們在戰鬥才努力至今的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以來  多謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.23,0:08:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是沒有你  一切都無法開始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  只是有過一個笨蛋而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走過頭了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.91,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1710,750)}Old  Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,片刻的喘息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天使…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  小奏也在努力著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能更早點注意到就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定就能友好相處了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.52,0:09:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟都是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是這樣的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:37.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也能為她找些漂亮的衣服什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…結果還是不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我還是不能原諒神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:55.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:10:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧  消失吧  消失吧 …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:19.79,up,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢  這裡的公式是十分重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  我剛才好像在想著什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼來著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要擦掉了哦  都抄好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  仲村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抄好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:33.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.71,0:10:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出醜了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.57,0:10:45.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才上課的時候在做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是在想事情而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在想事情？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連上課都心不在焉的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道說是戀愛？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是戀愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  是的話我還真想試試
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒是覺得藤原挺適合百合的說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…你有在聽嗎  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  藤原現在一個人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藤原
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你這…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  我是瞳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是瞳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀  你是不是生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也許吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這恐怕就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說是相思病吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說對了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到座位上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:37.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡要好好記住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:46.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仲村  你在看哪兒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼仲村
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接著從下頁開始讀起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:11:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.93,0:12:03.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很幸福呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此幸福的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對我來說太過耀眼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都活在這樣的時光裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:18.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好  真讓人羨慕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從這裡消失的話  能重新再來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣理所當然的幸福對於我來說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能接受得了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仲村…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去現在的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性格也隨之改變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話就能接受了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而這所謂的轉世算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那已經不是我的人生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.96,0:12:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是其他什麼人的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生對我來說是僅有一次的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:57.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在這裡…獨一無二的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不能託付給別人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能被奪走的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能推脫  不能忘記  不能消除  不能踐踏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能一笑而過  也不能美化  什麼都不能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能去接受這真實而殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但僅有一次的人生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師  你明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我要去戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不斷去戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這樣的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一輩子都不能接受！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手伸過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無和日向
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.77,0:13:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的聲音  不…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏說你的思念在爆發
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以帶我們來到了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小奏？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:16.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊  多虧了大家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被救了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你們為什麼在這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受人囑託
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家繼承了我們的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就來救我了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:31.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是來和你一起戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.40,0:14:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是  小百合總是那麼讓人擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先整理一下衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.81,0:14:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  還是那麼我行我素
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:01.34,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,400)\pos(1725,750)}Guild聯絡通道  B20
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  不覺得像是在保護那個地方嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀  真是巧  我也是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那麼多的敵人  不來個地毯式轟炸的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小奏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太愚蠢了  這等於是去自殺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.59,0:15:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的戰鬥力能和轟炸機媲美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  又出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合  你先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.49,0:15:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些傢伙由我們來收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被當成傻瓜了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.28,up,NTP,0,0,0,,第二電腦室
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  這次一定要…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底偷了多少啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真虧你能來到這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當我是傻瓜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是在門上貼了個牌子  生怕別人找不到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這裡是學校啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的價值觀可真是怪異
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  因為這是規則啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:51.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界的…神所制定的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神  究竟存不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這實在是個深奧的議題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人充滿好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我沒有查明這個的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是去做被規定好的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是由程式控制的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.47,0:17:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如你所推測的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰做了這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算說出名字也沒什麼意義吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那已經是很久以前的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ANGEL  PLAYER
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼軟體
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如你所知的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是能創造並改變這個世界的物質的軟體
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼能做到這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.58,0:17:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是開發者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你們也是用土來造武器的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果是遵循著相同的規則嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,製作這個軟體的人想成為神嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:52.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道呢  我無可奉告
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒時間了  直接進入正題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:18:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被設定在什麼情況下做這種事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:04.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,程式的內容我並不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我重新問
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對於你來說  這個世界發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:13.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個世界裡  愛開始萌芽了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.48,0:18:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  就是愛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.53,0:18:22.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不允許存在於這個世界裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊  的確是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如在這個世界裡感受到了愛  應該會立即消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果愛的種子發芽了  那這個世界會變成什麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛一旦萌芽了  這裡就會變成永恆的樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這個世界不能變成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這裡是應該畢業出去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人曾這麼想過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過偶爾也會有為了別人而活著
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,度過了一個釋然的人生的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為喪失了記憶而誤入這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那時就會發生這種BUG
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是開發了ANGEL  PLAYER的程式師
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.35,0:19:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讓我吃驚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人意識到了這個世界的BUG  並進行了修正
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是使用影子來NPC化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.61,0:19:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是RESET
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.38,0:19:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是說  在NPC之中還有像我們這樣的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個程式師
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等待著那個懂得了愛後就一個人離開了這個世界的她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能  明明沒有再次相遇的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是個天文數字  但並非是零
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但由於等待她的時間太過漫長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他逐漸失去了理智
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是就開發出了將自己NPC化的程式
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:20:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難不成是那個在先？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後為了不再發生同樣的事  就把程式運用於這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:06.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有這種可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人會有釋然的一天嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不知道什麼是對什麼是錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道什麼是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是能來到這裡的你  說不定能得出答案
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:30.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你的意志  能改變這個世界」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改變了又能怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能選擇他沒選擇的路
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是說我能成為神嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換種說法就是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.83,0:20:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把這裡變成永恆的樂園嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.29,0:20:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然他否定了這種可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我並不否定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  應該說我沒有否定任何事物的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神？  我能成為這個世界的神？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.65,0:21:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:13.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於得到了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:15.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我終於…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥至今就是為了這個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連天使也能勝過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.01,0:21:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了這樣的系統的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是最強的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼可能做出這樣的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對小奏也已經做不出那種事來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:41.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到這裡來的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.69,0:21:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感受到了愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如此巨大的還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以令人驚訝的速度在擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.22,0:22:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我到這裡來是為了保護大家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來發生源是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  你想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有的機器都關掉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在立即
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣可以嗎  好好考慮過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有的是時間哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至能稱為永恆的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  讓我來告訴你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是連短短十分鐘也等不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就…結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定都得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:22.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定都平安地離開了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.60,0:23:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但說回來  我真是太失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐把大家看得和你們一樣重了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明明只想成為能讓你們驕傲的  只愛你們的姐姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.94,0:23:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  這種感情究竟是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以來支撐著我的東西正在消失
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.82,0:23:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都消失了的話  我就無法再待在這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.31,0:24:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生明明是那麼沒道理  奪去了你們的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.91,0:24:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可與大家一起度過的這段時間也是無可替代的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.71,0:24:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我變得也想要跟著大家一起去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.86,0:24:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  已經足夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.47,0:24:25.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐不用再一個人痛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.98,0:24:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長久以來辛苦你了  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.12,0:26:47.21,next,NTP,0,0,0,,能和大家一起度過這段時光
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.76,0:26:48.89,next,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.52,0:26:51.51,next,NTP,0,0,0,,太感謝你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.16,0:26:55.47,next,NTP,0,0,0,,畢業生代表  音無結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
